# Demo comment tags

Tag the shortcut where it lives. Keep `docs/08-demo-plan.md` §4 in sync.

| Tag | Use for |
| --- | --- |
| `DEMO-ONLY:` | Unsafe or wrong in production. Follow with `PROD:`. |
| `PROD:` | What production should do instead. |
| `SANDBOX:` | Sandbox-only Airwallex behaviour, such as transfer simulation. |
| `AIRWALLEX:` | A non-obvious API constraint, with a docs link. |

```ts
// DEMO-ONLY: pricing runs inline in the request.
// PROD: queue add, delete, quote, and submit with the same request_id builders.
await priceRun(runId);

// SANDBOX: moves a transfer to the next status for the talk track.
await awx.simulation.transitionTransfer(transferId, 'PAID');
```

Audit: `rg -n "DEMO-ONLY:|SANDBOX:" src scripts`.
